# pubspec.lock is committed: this repo ships bin/airlock_service.dart as
# an application, not just a library the way is_journal's own are, and a
# compiled build's code hash should come from pinned versions, not
# whatever dart pub get happens to resolve on the day. See
# https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
